### Manual endpoint checks for the VS Code REST Client or the JetBrains HTTP client.
### Start the stack with `make up`, run "Create room", then paste the returned
### room code and session tokens into the variables below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090/api/v1
@code = PASTE_ROOM_CODE
@hostToken = PASTE_HOST_SESSION_TOKEN
@guestToken = PASTE_GUEST_SESSION_TOKEN

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Create room (caller becomes host)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName": "Ona"}

### Join room
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{code}}/participants
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName": "Jonas"}

### Get room state as guest
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{code}}
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

### Start round (host only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{code}}/round
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"label": "Login page", "jiraKey": "ABC-123"}

### Vote as guest (1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, 21)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{code}}/round/vote
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"card": "8"}

### Vote as host
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{code}}/round/vote
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"card": "5"}

### Reveal votes (host only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{code}}/round/reveal
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}

### Leave room as guest
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{code}}/participants/me
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

### Close room (host only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{code}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hostToken}}
